<title>CANADA: William Resources to sell 20 million shares.</title>
<headline>William Resources to sell 20 million shares.</headline>
<dateline>TORONTO 1996-09-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>William Resources Inc said on Friday a syndicate of underwriters led by ScotiaMcleod Inc on purchased for resale 20 million common shares at C$1.80 each for gross proceeds of C$36 million.</p>
<p>William Resources said about C$25 million would be used to finance capital expenditures and repay debt from the Jacobina Mine acquisition.</p>
<p>-- Reuters Toronto Bureau 416-941-8100</p>
</text>
